{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5f67d9d7-dab2-8cb5-b691-468c9455fe84",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:30:36-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:27:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Um, I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed, but somebody told me this number is the storm line for the evenings. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:27:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, you've got the storm line. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:27:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the storm drain. On the corner by my building, 149 Malbone Road. It's full to the top, the water is just sitting there. Not draining at all. Since the nor'easter Friday into Saturday, two days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 149 Malbone Road. Sorry, you're breaking up a little. Did you say it's full to the top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:27:38-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, full. To the top. [line breaks up] and the street is, uh, pooling up along the curb. I'm the landlord here, so I've got tenants, and I'm worried about it coming up toward the foundation if we get more rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:27:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Has it gone down at all since Saturday, or is it about the same?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:28:00-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same. Maybe worse. There's leaves and gravel packed on the grate, but even the water under it looks backed up. I called a while back about this drain, and I was told it's a state road. So the city doesn't handle it. That's what I got."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:28:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, parts of Malbone are state-maintained, that's possible. Do you remember who told you that, or about when?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:28:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[inaudible] sorry, no name. Some months ago. The person just said, state road, call the state. And I didn't have a number, so, nothing happened."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:28:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me write this up anyway so we have it on record, and I'll have somebody check whether that drain is ours or the state's. If it's the state's, we'll pass it along to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be great. So who do I call to get it checked? If it's the state, I mean. I don't want to be bounced around again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:28:59-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For now, let me be your first call. I'll log it tonight and the Public Works crew will look at ownership in the morning. If it turns out to be the state's, we'll tell you who to call. Can I get a number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:29:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0182. That's my cell, the signal's bad in this part of the house, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:29:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I've got 401-555-0182. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:29:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Walter Chase. C-H-A-S-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:29:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Chase. Is the water in anybody's yard or in the building right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not in the building. Not yet. The yard's soggy. Honestly the reason I'm so nervous is the ground floor unit. My tenant's been, uh, doing yoga on a mat in the living room right now, because the bedroom is cold, and I keep thinking, if water got in there, that's the floor she's using."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. If water starts coming toward the building, call back right away. This line is monitored in the evenings during storm response. And if it's an emergency, like water in the house, call 911."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay. And you'll note it's the drain, the grate, on the corner. Not the street itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:30:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Storm drain at the corner of 149 Malbone, full and not draining. It's in the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I appreciate it. Sorry, the line's [line breaks up] I'll let you go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're all set. Somebody will get back to you. Stay dry, Mr. Chase."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T18:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Goodnight."
    }
  ],
